{"2769270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Online Car Simulator", "steam_appid": 2769270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/f138d2bc80576f2ed5b2376a3e2b3544.webp?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;FROM ROOKIE CAR DEALER TO REGULAR GALLERY EMPIRE&quot;</strong><br>Start your adventure as a small car salesman and earn money by making profitable sales. Use the money you earn to buy new cars or upgrade your sales office. It's up to you to become a regular dealer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/327a1a349f7cee9e2fe747101576f8dc.poster.avif?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/327a1a349f7cee9e2fe747101576f8dc.webm?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/327a1a349f7cee9e2fe747101576f8dc.mp4?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/cfcd7ccf5c99a68ec56af7cb89e5bf84.webp?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;DISPLAY YOUR CAR TO REAL PLAYERS, BUY OR SELL IT IF YOU WANT&quot;</strong><br>Meet real players in a lobby and show off your car. If both parties agree, you can sell or buy a car.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/58a63db817fef9bcafdf995da24d644e.poster.avif?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/58a63db817fef9bcafdf995da24d644e.webm?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/58a63db817fef9bcafdf995da24d644e.mp4?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/211512cf4e17beb44bb39d39d0f4740d.webp?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;RACE WITH REAL PLAYERS TO SHOW THE POWER OF THE CAR&quot;</strong><br>Race against other players to show them the power of the car and your own driving skills. Collect rewards by winning the race.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/739c8f2961737fc60a7c64da348873ac.poster.avif?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/739c8f2961737fc60a7c64da348873ac.webm?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/739c8f2961737fc60a7c64da348873ac.mp4?t=1777207114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769270/extras/1f67157c6030c7789c40fdd1ac1b36b4.webp?t=1777207114\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><strong>&quot;FREELY MODIFY YOUR CAR, TRY TO CREATE THE MOST VALUABLE CAR&quot;</strong><br>Expand your car's mechanical capabilities by adding the parts you want. Freely change the exterior to create the most interesting car.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http